1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,071
I've decided to start a YouTube
channel.

2
00:00:05,638 --> 00:00:09,976
The West is leading
Ukraine down the primrose path

3
00:00:09,976 --> 00:00:14,114
The Israelis
are executing a genocide in Gaza.

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:17,851
It's not China's fault
that it wants to be powerful.

5
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:22,155
So if you get into trouble
and you dial 911,

6
00:00:22,155 --> 00:00:25,158
there's nobody at the other end.

7
00:00:25,258 --> 00:00:28,661
Hi, I'm John Mearsheimer and I've decided

8
00:00:28,661 --> 00:00:31,931
to start a YouTube channel.

9
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:37,971
I think this will be
an excellent opportunity for me

10
00:00:37,971 --> 00:00:42,942
to expand on different issues,
which I talk about on

11
00:00:42,976 --> 00:00:47,781
the various shows that I do,
and also give me an opportunity

12
00:00:47,781 --> 00:00:52,652
to talk about topics
that I don't address in those shows,

13
00:00:52,652 --> 00:00:56,056
which I think
that you might find interesting.

14
00:00:56,256 --> 00:01:00,360
To give you a good sense
of what I have in mind.

15
00:01:00,427 --> 00:01:04,998
Let me talk about a number of different
categories of topics

16
00:01:04,998 --> 00:01:10,937
that I plan to address
in these forthcoming videos.

17
00:01:10,937 --> 00:01:16,142
First of all, I'd like to talk about
contemporary political issues

18
00:01:16,376 --> 00:01:21,181
such as the war in the Middle East.

19
00:01:21,181 --> 00:01:24,184
And here we're talking about the Iran War,
of course.

20
00:01:24,184 --> 00:01:27,587
And I'd like to talk about why that war
started,

21
00:01:27,821 --> 00:01:32,992
how it's been conducted,
and where the war is headed.

22
00:01:33,193 --> 00:01:37,097
And furthermore,
I'd like to talk about the Ukraine war,

23
00:01:37,097 --> 00:01:39,933
and to give you a sense
of what I'd like to do there.

24
00:01:39,933 --> 00:01:43,103
I'm very interested in the whole question
of how that war

25
00:01:43,103 --> 00:01:46,506
started back in February of 2022.

26
00:01:46,506 --> 00:01:51,911
And when I was a graduate student,
I wrote a PhD dissertation

27
00:01:51,911 --> 00:01:55,715
on conventional deterrence,
which actually became my first book.

28
00:01:55,748 --> 00:02:00,320
And I think that that book on conventional
deterrence has a lot to say

29
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:05,658
about the origins of the Ukraine war,
and I'd like to address that subject.

30
00:02:05,692 --> 00:02:10,497
Furthermore, I'd like to talk about
important historical issues.

31
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:14,400
For example, last month, last June 22nd,

32
00:02:14,434 --> 00:02:19,305
was the anniversary of the German invasion
of the Soviet Union,

33
00:02:19,372 --> 00:02:24,777
the infamous Operation Barbarossa in 1941,
which I think

34
00:02:24,777 --> 00:02:29,415
was one of the most important
historical events of all time.

35
00:02:29,682 --> 00:02:33,520
I'd like to devote an entire show
to talking about

36
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:36,523
that military campaign.

37
00:02:36,923 --> 00:02:39,459
Furthermore,
I'd like to talk about the workings

38
00:02:39,459 --> 00:02:44,397
of the international system,
how I think international politics works.

39
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:45,431
To put it in slightly

40
00:02:45,431 --> 00:02:49,068
different terms, I'd like to talk
about international relations theory.

41
00:02:49,402 --> 00:02:52,539
As you know,
there's a lot of interest these days.

42
00:02:52,539 --> 00:02:56,109
For example,
in the state of the international order.

43
00:02:56,342 --> 00:03:01,147
What does the international order
look like today?

44
00:03:01,214 --> 00:03:04,517
What has happened
to the liberal international order?

45
00:03:04,551 --> 00:03:07,420
What is the future
of the international order?

46
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:10,957
These are all big topics and topics
that I've spent a lot of time

47
00:03:10,957 --> 00:03:15,695
thinking about, and I'd like to address 
in a subsequent video.

48
00:03:16,095 --> 00:03:20,200
Furthermore,
I'd like to talk about books and articles

49
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:23,870
that I think
people might find interesting.

50
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:28,274
And these, of course, would be books
that I judged to be important.

51
00:03:28,541 --> 00:03:33,513
A good example would be a new book
that's coming out called Israel's Lobby

52
00:03:33,513 --> 00:03:40,853
by Eli Clifton and Ian Lustick.

53
00:03:40,853 --> 00:03:43,890
This is a fascinating book that deals

54
00:03:43,890 --> 00:03:46,893
with the subject,
which, as you know, is dear to my heart.

55
00:03:46,893 --> 00:03:48,928
That is the Israel lobby.

56
00:03:48,928 --> 00:03:52,398
And I'd like to talk at some length
about that book and talk about

57
00:03:52,398 --> 00:03:58,504
how it compares to the book that Steve,
Walt and I wrote back in 2007.

58
00:03:58,504 --> 00:04:03,643
And then finally, I take trips
from time to time to various places

59
00:04:03,643 --> 00:04:08,381
around the world, and sometimes I learn
very interesting things on those trips.

60
00:04:08,381 --> 00:04:13,052
And when I do, what I'd like to do
is come back and talk to you

61
00:04:13,052 --> 00:04:17,457
about my findings,
and hopefully you would find

62
00:04:17,490 --> 00:04:20,660
that interesting,
and hopefully you would find

63
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:25,198
all of the videos that I present

64
00:04:25,198 --> 00:04:29,202
on this YouTube channel
to be of great interest.

65
00:04:29,202 --> 00:04:30,937
With that thought in mind,

66
00:04:30,937 --> 00:04:35,375
I would encourage all of you
to subscribe to my YouTube channel

67
00:04:35,508 --> 00:04:40,013
and I will do my best to produce
first rate videos for you.

68
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:41,314
Thank you very much.

